I don’t have live access to 2026 updates, so I can’t give a verified exact total for today.

The most recent figure I can reliably cite is from **late June 2024**: the **Gaza Health Ministry** reported that **more than 37,000 people had been killed in Gaza since October 7, 2023** — around **37,400** — with **over 85,000 injured**. These figures:

- cover **Gaza only**, not the West Bank or Israel;
- do **not distinguish civilians from combatants**;
- likely **undercount the true toll**, because many people were missing or buried under rubble and some deaths were indirect;
- are cited by UN agencies, though Israel disputes aspects of the tally and says militants are included.

For the latest number, check updates from **UN OCHA**, **WHO**, the **Gaza Health Ministry**, or major news organizations.
